    "title": "WireGuard Config API",
    "description": "Backend-only API for profiles managed by this adapter. Requires a Bearer API key. Responses include X-Request-ID (req_ plus 26 uppercase ULID characters). Platform ignores caller-selected IDs; VPN facades accept a single valid ID only after server authentication. Optional correlation metadata, never a credential or idempotency key. JSON DTO and command schemas unchanged.",
